<title>POLAND: BAYERISCHE TO OPEN POLISH POZNAN BRANCH.</title>
<headline>BAYERISCHE TO OPEN POLISH POZNAN BRANCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The German Bayerische Hypotheken und Wechsel Bank AG said in a Tuesday statement it would open on October 2 a branch in the western Polish town of Poznan after having opened a fully-owned Warsaw subsidiary last year.</p>
<p>The bank also said that on September 16 it raised the Polish subsidiary's capital to 89.5 million zlotys from 34 million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
